cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "bitstream-recompression-artifact"
abstract: >-
  Artifact for "Blind Video Recompression Detection via Bitstream-Level
  Encoding-Layer Features: A Controlled Protocol and a Negative Result".
  Bitstream-level (encoding-layer) feature extraction for MP4 files, plus a
  controlled two-arm protocol and the evaluation scripts that go with it.
  Both arms are encoded with the same codec and the same first-pass quality,
  so the single versus double comparison is not confounded by codec identity.
authors:
  - family-names: "Dong"
    given-names: "Huasong"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-14"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/adhoccn/bitstream-recompression-artifact"
keywords:
  - video forensics
  - bitstream analysis
  - feature extraction
  - two-arm protocol
  - reproducibility
  - negative result
